[al:加冕日CORONATION DAY]
[00:00.0]作词: Aya-亚夜-
[00:01.0]作曲: Aya-亚夜-
[00:02.0]编曲: Aya-亚夜-
[00:19.199] I sacrifice the light we were searching for. / 我献祭我们曾探寻的光芒
[00:22.232] The crucifix beneath is all other’s fault. / 十架苦像之下皆为他人的过错
[00:25.357] Lift my soul with affliction. / 用苦难倒挂我的灵魂
[00:27.246] Blood with a mission. / 鲜血肩扛使命
[00:28.769] In this inflection, I reclaim them all. / 在这曲折之中我会夺回一切
[00:31.317] Waiting for, dying for. / 期许着，渴求着
[00:33.042] Destruction of the pain in the blood. / 血液中痛楚的毁灭
[00:35.731] Flow with endless temptation. / 流淌着无尽的诱惑
[00:37.510] Kill them all! Kill them all! / 杀死他们！杀死他们！
[00:39.287] Destruction of the ego inside. / 内心中自我的毁灭
[00:41.947] Burn with the ember of sun. / 与太阳余烬一同灼烧
[00:45.868] Creation of doom. / 厄运的造物
[00:48.990] A dying nation. / 垂死的国度
[00:51.910] Like a blessing curse. / 像一个受祝福的诅咒
[00:55.341] Kill them all! / 杀死他们！
[01:15.099] All utter pain I swallow. / 所有我吞咽下的极度痛苦
[01:18.188] My sin will rise and hallow. / 我的罪孽会升格成圣
[01:35.409] Creation of doom. / 厄运的造物
[01:38.499] A dying nation. / 垂死的国度
[01:41.333] Like a blessing curse. / 像一个受祝福的诅咒
[01:44.850] Kill them all! / 杀死他们！
[01:59.222] I still despise you, useless mother f***er. / 我依然看不起你，没用的东西